Build the image

```
docker build -t cp-ansible:7.6.1 .
```


Check the connectivity with the hosts
```
docker run  -v ./cp:/data -it cp-ansible:7.6.1 ansible -i /data/hosts.yml -m ping all
```


Run cp-ansible

```
docker run  -v ./cp:/data -it cp-ansible:7.6.1 ansible-playbook -i /data/hosts.yml confluent.platform.all
```